<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HAG" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Aggée</para>
  <para style="toc1">AGGÉE</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aggée</para>
  <para style="toc3">Ag</para>
  <para style="mt1">AGGÉE</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HAG 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 1:1" />Nan dezyèm ane Darius, wa a, nan premye jou sizyèm mwa a, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini pa pwofèt <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:1">Esd 5:1</ref> </char></note>Aggée a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 7:7">Né 7:7</ref> </char></note>Zorobabel, fis a Schealthiel la, gouvènè a Juda, e a Josué, fis la a Jotsadak la, wo prèt la. Li te di: <verse eid="HAG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 1:2" />“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: ‘Pèp sa a di: “Lè a poko rive; lè pou rebati kay SENYÈ a.”’”<verse eid="HAG 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 1:3" />Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini pa Aggée, pwofèt la. Li te di: <verse eid="HAG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 1:4" />Èske se lè pou nou menm, pou nou rete nan kay panno nou pandan kay sila a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 33:10">Jr 33:10</ref>,<ref loc="JER 33:12">12</ref> </char></note>rete nan movèz eta? <verse eid="HAG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 1:5" />Alò, konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Konsidere chemen nou yo! <verse eid="HAG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 1:6" />Nou te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:38-40">Det 28:38-40</ref> </char></note>simen anpil, men rekòlt la te piti. Nou manje, men nou pa manje ase. Nou bwè, men li manke asi. Nou mete rad, men yo pa kont pou envite fredi, epi sila ki jwenn salè li a, li mete salè li a nan yon bous ki plen twou.”<verse eid="HAG 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 1:7" />Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Konsidere chemen nou yo! <verse eid="HAG 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 1:8" />Monte sou mòn yo, pote bwa pou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:1">I Wa 6:1</ref> </char></note>rebati tanp lan pou M kapab <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 132:13">Sòm 132:13</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 132:14">14</ref> </char></note>pran plezi e jwenn glwa ladann,” pale SENYÈ a. <verse eid="HAG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 1:9" />“Nou chache anpil, men gade byen, ti kras vin jwenn nou; lè nou te mennen l lakay nou, Mwen <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:7">És 40:7</ref> </char></note>soufle sou li pou fè l ale. Poukisa?” deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Akoz kay Mwen ki rete an movèz eta a, pandan nou tout ap byen okipe pwòp lakay nou. <verse eid="HAG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 1:10" />Akoz sa, akoz nou menm <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:23">Det 28:23</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 28:24">24</ref> </char></note>syèl la te vin ralanti nan lawouze li, e latè te vin refize pwodwi fwi li. <verse eid="HAG 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 1:11" />Mwen te rele yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 14:2-6">Jr 14:2-6</ref> </char></note>gwo sechrès vini sou peyi a, sou mòn yo, sou grenn sereyal yo, sou diven nèf la, sou lwil la, sou tout pwodwi latè yo, sou lòm, sou bèt ak sou tout zèv men nou yo.”<verse eid="HAG 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 1:12" />Konsa, Zorobabel, fis a Schealthiel la ak Josué, fis a Jotsadak la, wo prèt la ak tout retay a pèp la, te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:19">És 1:19</ref> </char></note>obeyi vwa a SENYÈ a, Bondye yo a, e pawòl a Aggée yo, pwofèt la, akoz se SENYÈ a, Bondye yo a ki te voye li. Epi pèp la te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:12">Det 31:12</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 31:13">13</ref> </char></note>montre lakrent pou SENYÈ a.<verse eid="HAG 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 1:13" />Answit Aggée, mesaje SENYÈ a, te pale nan komisyon SENYÈ a, bay pèp la. Li te di, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 46:11">Sòm 46:11</ref></char></note> “Mwen avèk nou, deklare SENYÈ a.”<verse eid="HAG 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 1:14" />Konsa, SENYÈ a te twouble lespri Zorobabel, fis a Schealthiel la, gouvènè a Juda a, lespri Josué, fis a Jotsadak la, wo prèt la ak lespri <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:12">Ag 1:12</ref> </char></note>retay pèp la; epi yo te vini <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:2">Esd 5:2</ref> </char></note>travay nan kay SENYÈ dèzame yo, Bondye yo a, <verse eid="HAG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 1:15" />nan venn-katriyèm jou sizyèm mwa a, nan dezyèm ane a Darius, wa a.<verse eid="HAG 1:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HAG 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HAG 2:1" />Nan venteyen jou nan setyèm mwa a, pawòl SENYÈ a te vin kote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:11">Ag 1:11</ref> </char></note>Aggée, pwofèt la. Li te di: <verse eid="HAG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HAG 2:2" />“Pale koulye a a Zorobabel, fis a Schealthiel la, gouvènè a Juda a, a Josué, fis a Jotsadak la, wo prèt la e a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:12">Ag 1:12</ref> </char></note>retay a pèp la e di: <verse eid="HAG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HAG 2:3" />‘Se kilès ki rete pami nou ki te wè tanp sa a lontan nan tout glwa li? Se kijan nou wè li koulye a? Èske li pa vin pa sanble anyen nan zye nou?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 3:12">Esd 3:12</ref></char></note> <verse eid="HAG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HAG 2:4" />Men koulye a, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 31:23">Det 31:23</ref> </char></note>se pou ou vin dyanm, Zorobabel,’ deklare SENYÈ a: ‘Se pou ou vin dyanm, ou menm tou, Josué, fis a Jotsadak la, wo prèt la, e tout pèp peyi a, se pou nou vin dyanm,’ deklare SENYÈ a: ‘epi travay, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:10">II Sam 5:10</ref> </char></note>Mwen avèk nou,’ deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="HAG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HAG 2:5" />Selon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:4-6">Egz 19:4-6</ref> </char></note>pwomès ke M te fè nou an, depi lè nou te sòti nan peyi Égypte la, Lespri M t ap viv pami nou. ‘Pa pè anyen!’ <verse eid="HAG 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HAG 2:6" />Paske konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:26">Eb 12:26</ref> </char></note>‘Yon fwa ankò <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:25">És 10:25</ref> </char></note>nan yon ti tan, Mwen va souke syèl yo, tè a, lanmè a ak tè sèch la. <verse eid="HAG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HAG 2:7" />Mwen va souke <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 2:44">Dan 2:44</ref> </char></note>tout nasyon yo. Konsa, <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 60:4-9">És 60:4-9</ref> </char></note>gwo richès de tout nasyon yo va vini, e Mwen va plen kay sa a ak glwa,’ pale SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="HAG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HAG 2:8" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 29:14-16">I Kwo 29:14-16</ref> </char></note>‘Ajan se pa M, e lò se pa M’, deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo. <verse eid="HAG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HAG 2:9" />‘Denyè <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 2:5">Za 2:5</ref> </char></note>glwa kay sa a, va pi gran ke ansyen an,’ pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: ‘Epi nan plas sa a, Mwen va bay <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:6">És 9:6</ref>,<ref loc="ISA 9:7">7</ref> </char></note>Lapè’, deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo.”<verse eid="HAG 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HAG 2:10" />Nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:20">Ag 2:20</ref> </char></note>venn-kat nan nevyèm mwa a, nan dezyèm ane Darius la, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini a Aggée, pwofèt la. Li te di: <verse eid="HAG 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HAG 2:11" />“Konsa pale SENYÈ dèzame yo: ‘Kounye a <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:8-11">Det 17:8-11</ref> </char></note>mande prèt yo konsènan Lalwa a. Mande yo: <verse eid="HAG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HAG 2:12" />Si yon nonm pote <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:37">Egz 29:37</ref> </char></note>vyann sakre vlope nan ke wòb li, e avèk ke wòb li, li touche pen, manje kwit, diven, lwil, oswa nenpòt lòt manje, èske sa ki touche pa li menm va vin sakre?’”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:12">Prèt yo te reponn: “Non”.<verse eid="HAG 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HAG 2:13" />Anplis, Aggée te mande: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 22:4-6">Lev 22:4-6</ref> </char></note>“Si yon moun ki pa pwòp akoz yon kadav, ta touche nenpòt bagay nan sa yo, èske moun sa va pa pwòp?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="HAG 2:13">Prèt yo te reponn: “Yo va vin pa pwòp.”<verse eid="HAG 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HAG 2:14" />Epi Aggée te di: <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 15:8">Pwov 15:8</ref> </char></note>“‘Se konsa pèp sa a ye. Epi se konsa nasyon sa a ye devan Mwen,’ deklare SENYÈ a: ‘Anplis, se konsa tout zèv men yo, ak sa ke yo ofri la yo, vin pa pwòp. <verse eid="HAG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HAG 2:15" />Alò, koulye a, m ap priye nou <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 1:5">Ag 1:5</ref>,<ref loc="HAG 1:7">7</ref> </char></note>byen konsidere sa soti nan jou sa a pou gade dèyè nèt: avan yon sèl wòch te plase sou yon wòch sou tanp SENYÈ a. <verse eid="HAG 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HAG 2:16" />Pandan tout tan sa a, lè yon moun te rive sou yon pil sereyal ak ven mezi, te gen sèlman dis. Lè yon moun te rive sou gwo ja diven, pou rale retire senkant mezi, te gen sèlman ven. <verse eid="HAG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HAG 2:17" />Tout zèv ki te fèt ak men nou yo, Mwen te frape ak <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:22">Det 28:22</ref> </char></note>destriksyon, lakanni, ak lagrèl. Malgre sa, nou pa t retounen vin jwenn Mwen,’ deklare SENYÈ a. <verse eid="HAG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HAG 2:18" /><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:29">Det 32:29</ref> </char></note>‘Byen konsidere sa, m ap priye nou. Soti nan jou sa a gade dèyè nèt, soti nan venn-katriyèm jou nan nevyèm mwa a; depi jou lè tanp SENYÈ a te <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZR 5:1">Esd 5:1</ref>,<ref loc="EZR 5:2">2</ref> </char></note>fonde a, konsidere sa: <verse eid="HAG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HAG 2:19" />Èske semans lan gen tan rive nan depo a? Menm pye rezen an, pye fig etranje a, pye grenad ak bwa doliv la, pa reyisi pote anyen. Malgre sa, soti nan jou sila a, Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 128:1-6">Sòm 128:1-6</ref> </char></note>beni nou.’”<verse eid="HAG 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HAG 2:20" />Konsa, pawòl SENYÈ a te vini yon dezyèm fwa a Aggée nan <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:10">Ag 2:10</ref> </char></note>venn-katriyèm jou nan mwa a e te di: <verse eid="HAG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HAG 2:21" />“Pale ak Zorobabel, gouvènè a Juda a e di: ‘Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAG 2:6">Ag 2:6</ref> </char></note>souke syèl yo ak tè a. <verse eid="HAG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HAG 2:22" />Mwen va <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 26:16">Éz 26:16</ref> </char></note>boulvèse twòn a wayòm yo, e detwi <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MIC 7:16">Mi 7:16</ref> </char></note>pouvwa wayòm a nasyon yo. Epi Mwen va boulvèse cha lagè yo ansanm ak sila k ap kondwi cha yo. Cheval yo ak chevalye yo va tonbe, yo tout pa nepe a frè yo.’ <verse eid="HAG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HAG 2:23" />‘Nan jou sa a,’ deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo: “Mwen va pran ou, Zorobabel, fis a Schealthiel la, sèvitè Mwen an,’ deklare SENYÈ a. ‘Epi konsa, Mwen va fè ou vin tankou yon <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="SNG 8:6">Kan 8:6</ref> </char></note> bag so, paske <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:1">És 42:1</ref> </char></note>Mwen te chwazi ou,’ deklare SENYÈ dèzame yo.”<verse eid="HAG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HAG 2" />
</usx>